1
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:03,000
Is anyone there?

2
00:01:05,359 --> 00:01:08,120
Is anyone there?

3
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,200
Help me!

4
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,120
Is anyone there?

5
00:01:15,159 --> 00:01:18,000
Is anyone there? Help me!

6
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,640
Goodbye, Professor.

7
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:26,840
Professor Yan is quite popular, I see.

8
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,800
Who are you?

9
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,439
Sun Ming, City Bureau.

10
00:02:33,919 --> 00:02:35,000
Ah, Captain Sun.

11
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,199
I've heard so much about you.

12
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,520
You know me?

13
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,840
I have many friends.

14
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:42,080
Many friends in the police force.

15
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,759
I have long heard of Captain Sun's fame.

16
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,360
Since you know me,

17
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:47,840
that makes things easier.

18
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,479
Let's have a chat.

19
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:50,759
Right here,

20
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,319
or will you pick a place?

21
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:53,439
How about

22
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:55,120
we go to the Literature and History Hall?

23
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:56,960
And take a tour while we're at it.

24
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,560
What?

25
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,360
Is it inconvenient?

26
00:03:02,919 --> 00:03:03,759
Of course not.

27
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:05,080
The Literature and History Hall

28
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,520
is a hobby of mine.

29
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,159
It is open to the public.

30
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,120
Shall we?

31
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:22,319
After you.

32
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,400
Mr. Yan,

33
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:32,439
this compound looks very grand.

34
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,080
You must have put a lot of effort into it.

35
00:03:34,919 --> 00:03:36,240
I certainly did.

36
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,560
It was nearly abandoned before.

37
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,919
I believe cultural relics need protection.

38
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:43,120
I just could not bear to see it ruined,

39
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,599
so I found a way

40
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:47,080
to restore it.

41
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:48,960
Judging by its scale,

42
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,120
it must have cost a lot of money.

43
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:52,680
You must be quite well-off, Mr. Yan.

44
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:54,039
You flatter me.

45
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:56,120
Because of my personal hobby,

46
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:58,520
I met a group of friends in the circle.

47
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,319
We all share the same vision,

48
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,319
so we pooled some money together

49
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,680
to rebuild it.

50
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:05,319
I just act as the manager.

51
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,400
After you.

52
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:20,199
The treasures of traditional culture

53
00:04:20,199 --> 00:04:22,480
cannot be lost by our generation.

54
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:25,000
That makes sense.

55
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,680
Please, feel free.

56
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,120
Oh, right, Mr. Yan.

57
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:47,199
Where were you last night?

58
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:50,040
I was at home all night.

59
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:51,120
Why do you ask?

60
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,720
Can anyone vouch for you?

61
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,639
Actually, no.

62
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:57,920
I live alone.

63
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:00,560
Captain Sun,

64
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:03,519
You do not suspect me of breaking the law?

65
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:04,680
Not at all.

66
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,160
It's just an occupational habit.

67
00:05:06,959 --> 00:05:08,759
Chatting feels like an interrogation.

68
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,759
Captain Sun,

69
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:13,079
you must be joking.

70
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,360
Being a cop is not easy.

71
00:05:15,879 --> 00:05:16,839
It is hard work.

72
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,839
I completely understand.

73
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,519
I heard

74
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,959
that your sister

75
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:23,120
was murdered because of your work.

76
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:28,480
It is truly not easy being a cop.

77
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:31,720
What do you mean by that?

78
00:05:34,759 --> 00:05:35,519
Excuse me.

79
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:36,360
I need to take this.

80
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,759
Hello?

81
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,319
Okay.

82
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,519
Captain Sun.

83
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:44,040
My apologies

84
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,839
for bringing up painful memories.

85
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,120
The principal wants to speak with me.

86
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,720
I cannot stay and chat.

87
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,319
Please.

88
00:07:31,959 --> 00:07:32,959
Is the body disposed of?

89
00:07:33,319 --> 00:07:34,120
Don't worry, sir.

90
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,120
It's been handled.

91
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,839
The police already have their eye on you.

92
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,040
Be careful.

93
00:07:38,519 --> 00:07:39,360
Understood.

94
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:46,199
Didn't I tell you not to get involved?

95
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:47,759
Why did you investigate on your own?

96
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:48,720
I didn't investigate.

97
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,120
I came here for a walk.

98
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:51,480
You...

99
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:52,680
Can't I?

100
00:07:54,879 --> 00:07:55,480
Anything else?

101
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:56,439
If not, I'm leaving.

102
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,480
Wait.

103
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:58,879
What did you find?

104
00:08:00,879 --> 00:08:01,759
I found nothing.

105
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:05,480
Yan Li is incredibly cunning.

106
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:07,079
He left no clues behind.

107
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,720
It was Yan Li

108
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,120
who exposed Gu Yan's identity.

109
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:11,759
Then him kidnapping Gu Ting

110
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,279
makes perfect sense.

111
00:08:15,279 --> 00:08:16,759
If I had found out the truth earlier,

112
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:19,560
I could have warned Gu Ting.

113
00:08:19,839 --> 00:08:21,160
It's too late for that now.

114
00:08:21,439 --> 00:08:22,560
I suspect

115
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,680
Yan Li bided his time to kidnap Gu Ting.

116
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,519
So,

117
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:26,560
in the short term,

118
00:08:26,879 --> 00:08:28,240
Gu Ting's life isn't in immediate danger.

119
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,839
But Gu Ting must feel very helpless now.

120
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:31,319
We need to think of a plan fast.

121
00:08:51,879 --> 00:08:54,399
Captain Sun, Yan Li's house is all clear.

122
00:09:38,159 --> 00:09:40,159
Look sharp, all of you.

123
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:41,960
Don't let anyone near.

124
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,679
Following the right guy

125
00:09:44,679 --> 00:09:46,679
is way more useful than blind effort.

126
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,879
Right?

127
00:09:55,039 --> 00:09:56,080
This old guy

128
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,840
is usually cunning and cautious.

129
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,360
But the moment his daughter's in trouble,

130
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,360
he's more impulsive than anyone.

131
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,039
Sun Ming.

132
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,320
Gu Yan sent his location.

133
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,159
Let's go.

134
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:18,840
Come out!

135
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:21,879
Gu Yan,

136
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,639
what are you doing here?

137
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,320
I'm a Veteran!

138
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,279
I know this place better than you!

139
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:33,279
Where is the owner of this watch?

140
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:38,919
You old fart.

141
00:10:39,519 --> 00:10:41,120
You and Li Wen really are up to something.

142
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:43,000
This has nothing to do with Li Wen.

143
00:10:43,639 --> 00:10:45,039
I did it all by myself.

144
00:10:45,679 --> 00:10:47,240
I wallow in the mire with you all day.

145
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,279
It makes me fucking sick!

146
00:10:50,679 --> 00:10:51,480
Beat him!

147
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:58,440
Beat him to death!

148
00:11:01,559 --> 00:11:02,519
Put some muscle into it!

149
00:11:10,519 --> 00:11:11,559
I'm an informant!

150
00:11:11,559 --> 00:11:12,639
The cops will be here soon.

151
00:11:12,639 --> 00:11:14,080
You're all dead meat!

152
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,440
I'll go check over there.

153
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:20,080
You two,

154
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:20,960
keep an eye on him.

155
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:31,960
This is too sketchy.

156
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,559
Let's go.

157
00:12:18,559 --> 00:12:19,600
Please, let me go!

158
00:12:26,279 --> 00:12:27,080
Drop the act.

159
00:12:27,679 --> 00:12:29,159
Your watch was broken.

160
00:12:29,399 --> 00:12:30,720
I threw it away.

161
00:12:31,159 --> 00:12:32,960
I bought you a new one.

162
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:34,559
Look.

163
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,200
This watch,

164
00:12:37,559 --> 00:12:39,519
is it not exactly the same as before?

165
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:41,960
I don't want anything from you!

166
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,240
I don't want anything from you!

167
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,080
I have been so good to you.

168
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,159
Why are you so ungrateful?

169
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,320
Who are you?

170
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,240
You are just like her.

171
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,519
I treated you both with sincerity.

172
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:55,440
I am truly angry.

173
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:57,639
Who are you, really?

174
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,399
I am so good to you.

175
00:12:59,759 --> 00:13:00,840
And yet you treat me like this.

176
00:13:01,679 --> 00:13:02,759
People with problems

177
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,600
must be educated.

178
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:42,000
Stop hitting him!

179
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:01,639
Tingting

180
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,279
Tingting

181
00:14:05,279 --> 00:14:06,080
Tingting

182
00:14:08,519 --> 00:14:09,320
Tingting

183
00:14:10,159 --> 00:14:11,279
Dad's here

184
00:14:11,799 --> 00:14:13,679
Dad
